        <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="f-1582_lbl" order="0" xlink:to="ft-1582_44142_lbl" />
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-43_44120_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1); font-family: Roboto">301 L13c, L14c, L15c</p><p style="margin: 0; color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1); font-family: Roboto">The net change in tax expense year over year (total increase of approximately $500K) is primarily driven by increase in tax expense due to a lower amount of 2024 federal excess tax benefit amortization related to 2017 Tax Reform, as well as an increase in tax expense resulting from an increase in pre-tax income.</p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-50_44121_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>Non-cash lease adjustment</p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-84_44122_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p>307 L2a, L4a, L15a, L19a</p><p>Costs charged from WBS to Dairyland Power Cooperative, Madison Gas and Electric, Wisconsin Power and Light Company, and WPPI Energy are based on contractual agreements that WPS and WE have with these parties.</p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-169_44126_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><div style="color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1); font-family: Roboto"><p style="margin: 0">Accounts Receivable balances comprised the following as of December 31:</p></div><table class="e-rte-table" style="color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1); font-family: Roboto"><tr><td class="" style="border: 1px solid rgba(189, 189, 189, 1); height: 20px; min-width: 20px; padding: 2px 5px; vertical-align: middle; width: 36.9062px"><br /></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgba(189, 189, 189, 1); height: 20px; min-width: 20px; padding: 2px 5px; vertical-align: middle; width: 390.125px"><br /></td><td class="" style="border: 1px solid rgba(189, 189, 189, 1); height: 20px; min-width: 20px; padding: 2px 5px; vertical-align: middle; width: 163.656px; text-align: center"><span style="text-decoration: underline">2024</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 28px"><td class="" style="border: 1px solid rgba(189, 189, 189, 1); height: 20px; min-width: 20px; padding: 2px 5px; vertical-align: middle; width: 36.9062px">143</td><td class="" style="border: 1px solid rgba(189, 189, 189, 1); height: 20px; min-width: 20px; padding: 2px 5px; vertical-align: middle; width: 390.125px">Accounts Receivable:</td><td class="" style="border: 1px solid rgba(189, 189, 189, 1); height: 20px; min-width: 20px; padding: 2px 5px; vertical-align: middle; width: 163.656px"><br /></td></tr><tr><td style="border: 1px solid rgba(189, 189, 189, 1); height: 20px; min-width: 20px; padding: 2px 5px; vertical-align: middle; width: 36.9062px"><br /></td><td class="" style="border: 1px solid rgba(189, 189, 189, 1); height: 20px; min-width: 20px; padding: 2px 5px; vertical-align: middle; width: 390.125px">A/R Due from Benefit Plans</td><td class="" style="border: 1px solid rgba(189, 189, 189, 1); height: 20px; min-width: 20px; padding: 2px 5px; vertical-align: middle