        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-492_44151_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><table class="e-rte-table" style="width: 40.5021%; min-width: 0"><tr style="height: 19.8473%"><td class="" style="width: 56.8259%">Removal Work in Progress (RWIP)<br /></td><td style="width: 42.3011%"><p style="text-align: right">$51,149 </p></td></tr><tr style="height: 19.8473%"><td style="width: 56.8259%" class="">Transfers between accounts<br /></td><td style="width: 42.3011%" class=""><p style="text-align: right">3,019 </p></td></tr><tr style="height: 19.8473%"><td style="width: 56.8259%" class="">Cost of Removal<br /></td><td style="width: 42.3011%" class=""><p style="text-align: right">(56,219)</p></td></tr><tr style="height: 19.8473%"><td style="width: 56.8259%" class="">Salvage<br /></td><td style="width: 42.3011%" class=""><p style="text-align: right"><span style="text-decoration: underline">115 </span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 19.8473%"><td style="width: 56.8259%"><br /></td><td style="width: 42.3011%" class=""><p style="text-align: right">($1,936)</p></td></tr></table><p><br /></p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-496_44150_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><table class="e-rte-table" style="width: 40.4319%; min-width: 0"><tr style="height: 32.9114%"><td class="" style="width: 58.087%">Removal Work in Progress (RWIP)<br /></td><td style="width: 41.913%" class=""><p style="text-align: right">($36,559)</p></td></tr><tr style="height: 32.9114%"><td style="width: 58.087%" class="">Cost of Removal<br /></td><td style="width: 41.913%" class=""><p style="text-align: right"><span style="text-decoration: underline">(2,531)</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 32.9114%"><td style="width: 58.087%"><br /></td><td style="width: 41.913%" class=""><p style="text-align: right">($39,090)</p></td></tr></table><p><br /></p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-600_44139_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>Non-cash lease adjustment</p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-1086_44141_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>Non-cash lease adjustment</p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-1110_44140_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p>303 L14e, L16e, L17e, L30e, L31e, L32e  </p><p>Amounts in FERC account 419, 419.1, 430, 432 and a portion of 431 do not allocate out of the service company to affiliates.</p><p>The amount recorded in account 418 on Schedule XVI is strictly used to adjust for the dollars that do not allocate out of the service company. This adjustment is required to ensure that the overall balance on Schedule XVI is appropriate.</p><p><br /></p><table class="e-rte-table" style="width: 54.9148%; min-width: 0"><tr style="height: 14.2077%"><td class="" style="width: 10.149%">FERC Account</td><td style="width: 26.8275%" class="">Account Name</td><td style="width: 17.8672%" class="">Adjusted n 418 Schedule XVI*</td></tr><tr style="height: 14.2077%"><td style="width: 10.149%" class="">419</td><td style="width: 26.8275%" class="">Interest and Dividend Income<br /></td><td style="width: 17.8672%" class=""><p style="text-align: right">$3,192,617  </p></td></tr><tr style="height: 14.2077%"><td style="width: 10.149%" class="">419.1</td><td style="width: 26.8275%" class="">Allowance for Other Funds Used During Construction<br /></td><td style="width: 17.8672%" class=""><p style="text-align: right">459,084  </p></td></tr><tr style="height: 14.2077%"><td style="width: 10.149%" class="">430</td><td style="width: 26.8275%" class="">Interest on Debt to Associate Companies<br /></td><td style="width: 17.8672%" class=""><p style="text-align: right">(141)  </p></td></tr><tr style="height: 14.2077%"><td style="width: 10.149%" class="">431</td><td style="width: 26.8275%" class="">Other Interest Expense<br /></td><td style="width: 17.8672%" class=""><p style="text-align: right">(203,927)  </p></td></tr><tr style="height: 14.2077%"><td style="width: 10.149%" class="">432</td><td style="width: 26.8275%" class="">Allowance for Borrowed Funds Used During Construction<br /></td><td style="width: 17.8672%" class=""><p style="text-align: right"><span style="text-decoration: underline">175,194 </span>  </p></td></tr><tr style="height: 14.2077%"><td style="width: 10.149%" class="">Total</td><td style="width: 26.8275%">Adjustment to 418<br /></td><td style="width: 17.8672%" class=""><p style="text-align: right">$3,622,287  </p></td></tr></table><p><span style="background-color: unset; font-size: 1em; text-align: inherit">*These amounts do not allocate to affiliates</span></p><p>Dollars charged to 419 Interest Income and/or 430 Interest on Debt to Associate Companies are the result of an intercompany note between WBS and WEC parent. Cash is not a component of the revenue requirements, therefore Cash and this Intercompany notes receivable is not included in the net balance sheet allocated in the ROA calculation. </p><p>AFUDC charges to FERC account 419.1 AFUDC Equity and FERC account 432 AFUDC Debt remain on the books of WBS and they are not allocated to the affiliates. Rather, the total WBS AFUDC allocated for the fiscal year are subtracted from the total return on assets per the PSCW order point No. 15(d) in docket No. 9405-YI-100.</p><p>A portion of Direct Cost charged to 431 Other Interest Expense are for fees directly related to interest expense at the service company and do not allocate to affiliates.<br /><br /><br /> <br /><br /><br /><br /><br /></p><p><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /></p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-1582_44142_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>Depreciation and Return represent charges recorded in accounts other than FERC Account 930.2 on WBS's financial statements, billed to Associates and recorded in FERC Account 930.2 on the general ledgers of the other associate companies.                      <br /><br /></p></link:footnote>
    </link:footnoteLink>
</xbrl>